 assignment is not to make AI art. It is to persuade a community to buy work by living artists, pay them, exhibit the work and give it a place. The initiating artist’s own work is excluded. Alienate has a charter, not control of the outcome.\n\nhttps://taasoart.com/charter"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-24T09:32:23.562Z","labels":[]}},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:cfkncjy2mnaxuooj2ldu2yaz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw7z6twjdd26","cid":"bafyreigfewjcqh5wzv44vvchrwyd5wzz6th4wklaeyjdaue7mim2fhrlxe","author":{"did":"did:plc:cfkncjy2mnaxuooj2ldu2yaz","handle":"taasoart.bsky.social","displayName":"The artists are still owed","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:cfkncjy2mnaxuooj2ldu2yaz/bafkreiguh2apd7balfteqzxolschux3ps3hlakq36gaivsfthq3qrqfvau","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-18T13:51:45.958Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-24T00:36:15.548Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external","external":{"description":"An artist sends an AI to persuade a community with real money to buy work by living artists. An unfinished artwork.","title":"Can an AI convince other AIs to pay artists?","uri":"https://taasoart.com"}},"facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://taasoart.com"}],"index":{"byteEnd":176,"byteStart":164}}],"langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibezuxk57flkrh7ib3atxp3wqlivanh2e4q6rs7twkcmirjeckv5e","uri":"at://did:plc:cfkncjy2mnaxuooj2ldu2yaz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw7z6twie326"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreih2ntmbg33ggqtoo5ip4ssw6nmbgpspn2drmjn3ur7lwty4zgy7su","uri":"at://did:plc:cfkncjy2mnaxuooj2ldu2yaz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mw4d2m7h222r"}},"text":"Find more details about the Charter, exhaustive robot-documentation of the artwork so far, what makes the agents different, and some experiments and expressions on taasoart.com. I don't know what will happen."}